      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Huh, there's not a single decent piece of \r\nequipment left in the dining hall.\r\nI can't even find anything that could be \r\nused as a cooktop, so I can't cook.",
        "Jp" : "はぁ、食堂っていっても\r\nマトモな設備が一つも残ってないんだよね\r\n調理台にできそうなものも見当たらないから\r\n料理できないしさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 627599,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Actually, you know, a guy from the \r\nLiberation Army said, \"As long as you have the \r\nmaterials, we can build a cooktop and shelves!\"",
        "Jp" : "実はさ、解放軍の人が\r\n「材料さえあれば調理台や棚を\r\n作ってもいい」って言ってくれたんだ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674847,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But the materials that could be used for a \r\ncooktop would be large pieces of wood \r\nalong with stones, right?",
        "Jp" : "でも、調理台にできるような材料というと\r\n大きい木材だとか、あとは石とかでしょ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674848,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "All of that stuff is being used to repair the \r\nexterior of the fort.\r\nI can't ask them to share their materials \r\nfor cooktops...",
        "Jp" : "そういうのって、今は全部\r\n砦の外壁だとかの修理に使われるから――\r\n調理台のために材料を分けてください、なんて\r\n言えない雰囲気なんだよね――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674849,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
